msgid "Endless Rift: you steer %s (the first hero you picked); the others follow and fight on their own. Your build comes along: gear, skills, equipped relics, dodge and mending, and each hero's Ability. Survive the waves, and beat the Rift Warden at 20:00 to seal the rift."
